        <mxCell id="FdTnytR_WRJY2KzvcyKx-26" value="&lt;ul style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;The sales manager has to decide to accept or reject cancellation considering all the factors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;If accepted, these material once received and stocked will be tagged as SM and will be offered in Special Sales.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot; color=&quot;#ff0000&quot;&gt;Any loss will be attributed to this order. If sold, this loss or provision will be reversed.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#484848;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#484848;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=-27;spacing=1;meaKind=activity;" parent="1" vertex="1">
