        <mxCell id="mzliQ4o1WE9GHevf3ZLB-4" value="&lt;ul style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;Process to handle Special orders with MOQ from vendor.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;For exmaple: we need to order 100 PCE (supplier MOQ) for a project it require only 60 PCE of this item. the Additional 40 PCE cost will be attributed to the same order and stock with 0 Value and make it part of slow moving sales from day1.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;Order cancellation&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;reduction of quantity in SO&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;Credit note report to cross check the flow entry&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=2;spacingLeft=-27;align=left;flipV=1;fontFamily=Arial;spacingTop=0;spacing=1;labelBorderColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#000000;meaKind=text;" parent="1" vertex="1">
